affiliates can earn<br>Affiliates earn 30% commission on every sale through their referral link. We also provide a personal 30% discount for affiliates and a custom 10% discount code for their audience to increase conversions.</p><p>How to promote us<br>Promote through TikTok, Instagram, Reddit, or Telegram. Use your referral link in bio and mention the brand naturally in content related to peptides, recovery, fat loss, and aesthetics.</p><p>Other information<br>We ship across Europe with delivery in 8 to 10 business days using DPD. We provide full support, content ideas, and product guidance to help affiliates generate consistent income.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><br></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"><br></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\"><br></div></div></div>",
